e prose-lg max-w-none text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed text-justify space-y-6 [&_p]:mb-4 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-5 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-5","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Set among the mist-shrouded hills of Kerala’s Western Ghats, Wayanad offers a more secluded and deeply immersive side of the state. Lush forests, coffee and spice plantations, waterfalls and remote valleys create a landscape made for slowing down and exploring at an unhurried pace.<br>Beyond its natural beauty, Wayanad is home to several indigenous communities whose traditions remain closely connected to the forest. With the guidance of knowledgeable local hosts, a carefully arranged tribal visit offers an opportunity to learn about their distinctive customs, crafts, food and intimate understanding of the natural world. Add walks through plantations, wildlife excursions and the enigmatic Edakkal Caves, lets you enjoy Wayanad where nature, culture and rural life come together with a sense of discovery.</p>"}}],null]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"lg:col-span-1","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"sticky top-32 space-y-8","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-card rounded-3xl p-8 border border-border shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden group","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-primary/5 rounded-bl-full transform translate-x-8 -translate-y-8 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-4 group-hover:translate-y-4 duration-700"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 relative z-10","children":"Plan a Visit"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground mb-8 relative z-10 leading-relaxed text-left","children":["Interested in visiting ","Wayanad","? Get in touch with our travel experts to craft your perfect itinerary."]}],["$","form",null,{"className":"space-y-4 relative z-10","children":[["$","input",null,{"type":"text","placeholder":"Your Name","className":"w-full px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-muted border b